      "text": [
        " الرَّجُلِ يَشْتَرِي الْجَارِيَةَ الْحُبْلَى فَيَنْكِحُهَا وَ هُوَ لَا يَعْلَمُ قَالَ يَرُدُّهَا وَ يَكْسُوهَا."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Aban, from Muhammad Bin Muslim, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Ja’far<sup>asws</sup> regarding the man who buys the pregnant slave girl, so he copulates with her but he did not know’. He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘He should return her and clothe her’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "8. Humayd has narrated from al-Hassan ibn Muhammad from al-from more than one person from Aban from ‘Abd al-Rahman ibn abu ‘ Abd Allah who has said the following: “About the case of a man who buys a slave-girl, then does sexual intercourse, then finds her to be pregnant, abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘He must return her with something.’” "
        ]
      }
